SUMMARY:St. John The Compassionate Mission "Friendly Visitors Program"
DESCRIPTION:St. John The Compassionate Mission “Friendly Visitors Program” is welcoming new volunteers. FVP visit people who are shut in\, referred either by agencies or individuals living in the east of Toronto. Many of the folks we are visiting have been previously homeless or in difficult life situations. This requires from our friendly visitors a deeply compassionate\, non-judgmental approach. \nInterested persons can email at: info@stjohnsmission.org  /attention Starotza Miroslava \nA prompt reply is promised.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/st-john-the-compassionate-mission-friendly-visitors-program/
LOCATION:St. John The Compassionate Mission\, 155 Broadview Ave.\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
